§ `ss 3, 19 -- am I a child for this charge (k022 at 15)`

#ASSERT `Am I a child for this charge` (Date 30 8 2006) (Date 20 11 2021) FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `Am I a child for this charge` (Date 30 8 2006) (Date 30 8 2024) FALSE
#ASSERT `Am I a child for this charge` (Date 30 8 2006) (Date 30 8 2024) TRUE

§ `s 19B -- may I choose a trial on indictment`

#ASSERT NOT `May I elect to be tried on indictment` `Jake's shop theft, if charged`
#ASSERT `May I elect to be tried on indictment` `the same theft, the Court decides on indictment and Jake elects`
#ASSERT `May I elect to be tried on indictment` `an offence an adult must be tried for on indictment, Jake elects`

#ASSERT NOT `Must the Court tell me I may elect a trial on indictment` `Jake's shop theft, if charged`
#ASSERT `Must the Court tell me I may elect a trial on indictment` `the same theft, the Court decides on indictment and Jake does not elect`

#ASSERT NOT `Can I have a jury in the Children's Court`

§ `ss 19, 19B-19D, 30 -- which court deals with my charge (k022: 'which court if they charge?')`

-- k022: had police charged Jake instead of referring him, the Children's Court would hear the theft summarily.
#ASSERT `Which court deals with my charge` `Jake's shop theft, if charged` EQUALS `the Children's Court`
#ASSERT `Which court deals with my charge` `the same theft, the Court decides on indictment and Jake elects` EQUALS `the Supreme Court or District Court, on indictment, because I elected`
#ASSERT `Which court deals with my charge` `the same theft, the Court decides on indictment and Jake does not elect` EQUALS `the Children's Court`
#ASSERT `Which court deals with my charge` `the same theft, with an adult co-accused tried on indictment` EQUALS `the Supreme Court or District Court, on indictment, jointly with an adult`
#ASSERT `Which court deals with my charge` `the 2021 theft charged in 2047, transferred under s 19D` EQUALS `the Magistrates Court, on transfer because I am now 18`
#ASSERT `Which court deals with my charge` `the 2021 theft charged in 2047, not transferred` EQUALS `the Children's Court`
#ASSERT `Which court deals with my charge` `a theft on his 18th birthday` EQUALS `an adult court: I was not a child at the offence`
#ASSERT `Which court deals with my charge` `a theft on his 18th birthday, age uncertain and charged as a possible child` EQUALS `the Children's Court`

#ASSERT `Could my charge be transferred because I have turned 18` `the 2021 theft charged in 2047, not transferred`
#ASSERT NOT `Could my charge be transferred because I have turned 18` `Jake's shop theft, if charged`

#ASSERT `May I elect to pay a prescribed penalty instead` TRUE

